  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Shadowy Void energy erupts in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in the Sphere makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 5d6 Necrotic damage on a failure or half as much on a success. At the same time, you take on a Void form that grants you the following benefits for the duration.</p><p><strong>Void Bolt.</strong> As a Bonus Action on your turn, you can hurl a bolt of Void energy at a creature within 60 feet of yourself. Make a ranged spell attack; on a hit, the target takes Necrotic damage equal to 2d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.</p><p><strong>Void Stealth.</strong> While you are in Dim Light or Darkness, you have the &amp;Reference[invisible apply=false]{Invisible} condition.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-qkFEDS2bQdgHzKFh\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The Void Form effect marks you; give yourself the Invisible condition by hand while you are in Dim Light or Darkness.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
